odotengine/godot/pull/104872.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-15T00:42:50Z"},"body":"- Allows independent per-viewport oversampling (required for automatic DPI scaling). Previously was global value and only truly supported for the main window.\r\n- Allows overriding oversampling factor manually.\r\n- Oversampling can reuse existing font data if possible (e.g, if you have 16 and 32 size fonts already in use, and oversampling of 2x, oversampled 16 font will reuse 32 font data).\r\n- Change of oversampling factor won't reload all fonts.\r\n- Oversampling use 16.6 fractions units for font size (have more scaling steps, and won't reload font if scaling change is too small).\r\n- ~~Adds performance monitors for `TextServer` fonts and oversampling.~~","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104872/reactions","total_count":26,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":5,"eyes":6},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104872/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_r